# 自帶矩形面:auto 兩端各頂一支已放角材的側面(沒有輪廓邊也合法)
# 主支在 v=1000(v∈[1000,1020])與 v=2000(v∈[2000,2020])沿 u 放
# auto 沿 v 放 u=1500:下頂主支1側面(1020)上頂主支2側面(2000)→ L=980
placement 1 origin 0 0 2500 u +x v +y rect 0 0 4000 3000
grid 1 on 1 u 1500
timber 1 3000 20 20
timber 2 3000 20 20
timber 3 27 33
place 1 on 1 at 500 1000 +u +n
place 2 on 1 at 500 2000 +u +n
place 3 on 1 at-grid 1 u 0 through 1500 +v +n
